Reviewing the previous phase. The critical tech-debt issue is that all design system components use `Html.Attributes.style "all" cssString` incorrectly — `style` takes `name` and `value` as separate arguments, not a raw CSS string. This means styles are never actually applied.

Let me fix this in all affected components (Alert, Badge, Card, Progress, Spinner, Container):
